(556146, 56573, 14499, '<td valign="top">Now this is a nice image... Its of something simple and yet there is a different air about it. The Guys that I gave coments to saying to do a little better in the angle of resolution department should pay attention to this! Back Lite... Black and white. If it were in colour it would look... well.. like toys.</td>', 'Now this is a nice image... Its of something simple and yet there is a different air about it. The Guys that I gave coments to saying to do a little better in the angle of resolution department should pay attention to this! Back Lite... Black and white. If it were in colour it would look... well.. like toys.', '2004-01-25 10:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(556150, 56602, 14499, '<td valign="top">Once again I am not sure you are supposed to apply these sort of effects in this comp? It does look like a photoshop effect, correct me if I am wrong? I thought the rule was if a effect was used it had to be added to the image as a whole and not part of.</td>', 'Once again I am not sure you are supposed to apply these sort of effects in this comp? It does look like a photoshop effect, correct me if I am wrong? I thought the rule was if a effect was used it had to be added to the image as a whole and not part of.', '2004-01-25 10:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
