(556364, 56638, 1176, '<td valign="top">This one is my favorite in this challenge - 9</td>', 'This one is my favorite in this challenge - 9', '2004-01-25 16:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(556375, 56635, 7628, '<td valign="top">This picture requires three looks - #1 hey, that''s a tree not a rabbit  #2 Oh! cool, look rabbit tracks  #3 Wait!  Those tracks go THROUGH the tree!  <br/>obviously I think this is very creative.  I like the composition of the tree hanging down over the scene, reminds me of a bonsai tree - small but looks big, or big but looks small.  I like seeing all those tiny pine needles poking out from the snow.  When I look really closely they seem a bit too sharpened maybe. small matter.  9</td>', 'This picture requires three looks - #1 hey, that''s a tree not a rabbit  #2 Oh! cool, look rabbit tracks  #3 Wait!  Those tracks go THROUGH the tree!  obviously I think this is very creative.  I like the composition of the tree hanging down over the scene, reminds me of a bonsai tree - small but looks big, or big but looks small.  I like seeing all those tiny pine needles poking out from the snow.  When I look really closely they seem a bit too sharpened maybe. small matter.  9', '2004-01-25 17:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(556377, 56591, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle on a horse.  I like how the DOF differentiates between one side and the other. The eyes glows, the coat and bone structure nicely defined. 8</td>', 'Interesting angle on a horse.  I like how the DOF differentiates between one side and the other. The eyes glows, the coat and bone structure nicely defined. 8', '2004-01-25 17:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(556378, 56718, 7628, '<td valign="top">Graphically the photo is nice - the two color background, white banner through one side.  The bunny is crisply portrayed.  The banner is a bit odd - It doesn''t go all the way to the bottom and seems cut off at the top.  The bunny himself (herself?) is adorable, but a bit corny.  The lighting seems a bit yellow, color correction would solve that.</td>', 'Graphically the photo is nice - the two color background, white banner through one side.  The bunny is crisply portrayed.  The banner is a bit odd - It doesn''t go all the way to the bottom and seems cut off at the top.  The bunny himself (herself?) is adorable, but a bit corny.  The lighting seems a bit yellow, color correction would solve that.', '2004-01-25 17:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(556380, 56734, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and shadows, and I like how the red cloth is refleted in the pig.  I guess the pig is yellow?  But I can''t get past the feeling the light is too yellow - I think it would have more impact if the pig were brighter, and the red more red.  Color cast would be a simple solution, and maybe bump the contrast a little.</td>', 'Nice shapes and shadows, and I like how the red cloth is refleted in the pig.  I guess the pig is yellow?  But I can''t get past the feeling the light is too yellow - I think it would have more impact if the pig were brighter, and the red more red.  Color cast would be a simple solution, and maybe bump the contrast a little.', '2004-01-25 17:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(556382, 56687, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the composition the way the sheep is "caught" between the snow and the gray branches.  The light is a bit flat, the sheep blends into the background a bit much.  What would happen if you played with the contrast a bit?  The snow is already a bit bright, I''d selectively exclude that from any changes.</td>', 'I like the composition the way the sheep is "caught" between the snow and the gray branches.  The light is a bit flat, the sheep blends into the background a bit much.  What would happen if you played with the contrast a bit?  The snow is already a bit bright, I''d selectively exclude that from any changes.', '2004-01-25 17:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(556383, 56737, 15413, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful color and composition.', '2004-01-25 17:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(556384, 56540, 7628, '<td valign="top">It is a bit of a puzzle - and I like that - look for the dragon.  I found it - head on the upper right.  Perhaps to rotate this a bit clockwise to make it a bit more dramatic composition, and since this is an "advanced editing" you could make the "eye" red or green to aid the imagination a bit.</td>', 'It is a bit of a puzzle - and I like that - look for the dragon.  I found it - head on the upper right.  Perhaps to rotate this a bit clockwise to make it a bit more dramatic composition, and since this is an "advanced editing" you could make the "eye" red or green to aid the imagination a bit.', '2004-01-25 17:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(556388, 56608, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a superb image - it just has such a lot of humour in it. Good choice to go black and white and strong composition!</td>', 'What a superb image - it just has such a lot of humour in it. Good choice to go black and white and strong composition!', '2004-01-25 17:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(556389, 56659, 7628, '<td valign="top">The composition is cute.  Tho small, I''m sure this dog is faithful, determined, energetic and has a big heart.  The green of the tree and the red of the soil go well with the dog''s color.  I like how it looks with the top half cropped too - maybe not as cute, but attention is more drawn to the dog.</td>', 'The composition is cute.  Tho small, I''m sure this dog is faithful, determined, energetic and has a big heart.  The green of the tree and the red of the soil go well with the dog''s color.  I like how it looks with the top half cropped too - maybe not as cute, but attention is more drawn to the dog.', '2004-01-25 17:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(556391, 56689, 3087, '<td valign="top">Witty title but image is very unappealing. No contrast, no focal point, no composition to speak of...</td>', 'Witty title but image is very unappealing. No contrast, no focal point, no composition to speak of...', '2004-01-25 17:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(556392, 56611, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strongest entry by far for me - superb use of light and, just as importantly, shadow. Very enigmatic.<br/></td>', 'Strongest entry by far for me - superb use of light and, just as importantly, shadow. Very enigmatic.', '2004-01-25 17:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(556395, 56495, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up.  All that wonderful warm fur and wiskers, and big shiny black eye on the thirds line - well thought out.  The snowy background works well, and the shadowy edge of the rabbits nose contrasts well with the white/blue of the snow. 8</td>', 'Nice close-up.  All that wonderful warm fur and wiskers, and big shiny black eye on the thirds line - well thought out.  The snowy background works well, and the shadowy edge of the rabbits nose contrasts well with the white/blue of the snow. 8', '2004-01-25 17:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(556401, 56502, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the simple lines and the lighting gives a slight shadow to the edge under the nose and front leg giving a touch of the 3rd dimension and it fades to the rear and becomes two dimensional. Very elegant.  You really saturated the red, it looks cool, but I have the feeling that subtlety in color would work better with your elegant lighting.  I hope you post a version with realistic colors  after the competition. 8</td>', 'I like the simple lines and the lighting gives a slight shadow to the edge under the nose and front leg giving a touch of the 3rd dimension and it fades to the rear and becomes two dimensional. Very elegant.  You really saturated the red, it looks cool, but I have the feeling that subtlety in color would work better with your elegant lighting.  I hope you post a version with realistic colors  after the competition. 8', '2004-01-25 17:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(556403, 56608, 7628, '<td valign="top">Sheep!  Wonderful Sheep!  What a super black and white, catures their expressions perfectly.  Great range, tone.  The composition is classic.  Are these Icelandic?  my favorite. 10</td>', 'Sheep!  Wonderful Sheep!  What a super black and white, catures their expressions perfectly.  Great range, tone.  The composition is classic.  Are these Icelandic?  my favorite. 10', '2004-01-25 17:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(556405, 56676, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful monkey - an exotic face.  The red of the heat lamp is a bit distracting, could you desaturate the red a bit?  The focus is a bit soft or resolution low- this must be at a distance through glass, a difficult situation.</td>', 'What a beautiful monkey - an exotic face.  The red of the heat lamp is a bit distracting, could you desaturate the red a bit?  The focus is a bit soft or resolution low- this must be at a distance through glass, a difficult situation.', '2004-01-25 17:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(556409, 56651, 7628, '<td valign="top">Marvelous dragon.  I like all the details in the scales.  The light on the right is a bit glaring.  A shallower depth of field would blur out the parts int the background and make the face "pop" out a bit more.</td>', 'Marvelous dragon.  I like all the details in the scales.  The light on the right is a bit glaring.  A shallower depth of field would blur out the parts int the background and make the face "pop" out a bit more.', '2004-01-25 17:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(556412, 56738, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I like the crispness of the fur against the gray background., the shadowed eyes and the shiny nose.  I wish the paw on the left and the tips on the ears were in focus too.  The paw in particular distracts the eye from the pup''s face.</td>', 'Cute.  I like the crispness of the fur against the gray background., the shadowed eyes and the shiny nose.  I wish the paw on the left and the tips on the ears were in focus too.  The paw in particular distracts the eye from the pup''s face.', '2004-01-25 17:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(556417, 56720, 7628, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  I like the white and red theme.  I think flatter lighting would work more effectively - the shadow on the right is ditracting.  You want to barely see how the glass is in fron of the background.  If the light is coming from on side you can balance it by bouncing it back with a white board on the other side or another light.</td>', 'Neat idea.  I like the white and red theme.  I think flatter lighting would work more effectively - the shadow on the right is ditracting.  You want to barely see how the glass is in fron of the background.  If the light is coming from on side you can balance it by bouncing it back with a white board on the other side or another light.', '2004-01-25 17:39:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(556420, 56750, 7628, '<td valign="top">big warm furry horse in a wintery scene.  I like the angle.  The lighting is nice.  Focus a bit soft (but so is the horse!)  Lacks a "wow" somehow, but very comfortable and pleasing.</td>', 'big warm furry horse in a wintery scene.  I like the angle.  The lighting is nice.  Focus a bit soft (but so is the horse!)  Lacks a "wow" somehow, but very comfortable and pleasing.', '2004-01-25 17:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(556423, 56752, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the definition you caught in all that white fur.  Wish the nose were sharper. and the circular shadow effect feels a bit odd.  The cozy bed material the pup is lying on is confusing because at first I thought it was part of the dog or maybe snow - a flat floor or a darker material would contrast better (but maybe this sweet dow wouldn''t like it as much)</td>', 'I like the definition you caught in all that white fur.  Wish the nose were sharper. and the circular shadow effect feels a bit odd.  The cozy bed material the pup is lying on is confusing because at first I thought it was part of the dog or maybe snow - a flat floor or a darker material would contrast better (but maybe this sweet dow wouldn''t like it as much)', '2004-01-25 17:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(556424, 56717, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a tower of rooster-hood! (hen-hood?) Nice use of DOF, great colors and contast.  9</td>', 'What a tower of rooster-hood! (hen-hood?) Nice use of DOF, great colors and contast.  9', '2004-01-25 17:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(556426, 56562, 7628, '<td valign="top">Light is a bit bright, background a bit distracting.  He looks like a sweet well loved friend.  Perhaps a close up of his face with subtler lighting, a study of the textures of the fur and the eyes.</td>', 'Light is a bit bright, background a bit distracting.  He looks like a sweet well loved friend.  Perhaps a close up of his face with subtler lighting, a study of the textures of the fur and the eyes.', '2004-01-25 17:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(556427, 56561, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy effect and the light catching the winter coats of these horses.  The composition is incomplete feeling both horses are cropped oddly.</td>', 'I like the grainy effect and the light catching the winter coats of these horses.  The composition is incomplete feeling both horses are cropped oddly.', '2004-01-25 17:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(556428, 56482, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great detail - captures textures well.  Nice composition. well done. 9</td>', 'Great detail - captures textures well.  Nice composition. well done. 9', '2004-01-25 17:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(556430, 56702, 7628, '<td valign="top">great eye!  What a comb too.  good use of DOF - wish bottom weren''t cropped so close, and I might crop a bit more on the left.</td>', 'great eye!  What a comb too.  good use of DOF - wish bottom weren''t cropped so close, and I might crop a bit more on the left.', '2004-01-25 17:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(556433, 56568, 7628, '<td valign="top">those bones in the background are fascinating - what is the story here?  The ox is well caught too - nice detail, great expression, I like the sepia tone.</td>', 'those bones in the background are fascinating - what is the story here?  The ox is well caught too - nice detail, great expression, I like the sepia tone.', '2004-01-25 17:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(556435, 56611, 7628, '<td valign="top">great idea.  Love the color of that eye.  The lighting works perfecly, very dramatic and transforming.  Seems like the picture could be a bit sharper tho. 8</td>', 'great idea.  Love the color of that eye.  The lighting works perfecly, very dramatic and transforming.  Seems like the picture could be a bit sharper tho. 8', '2004-01-25 17:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(556437, 56590, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wow!<br/>10 for national geographic &amp; chinese zodiac :)<br/>Really really really love the lighting of this object. Clear &amp; well sharepened.<br/>Excellent.</td>', 'Wow!10 for national geographic & chinese zodiac :)Really really really love the lighting of this object. Clear & well sharepened.Excellent.', '2004-01-25 17:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(556438, 56638, 7628, '<td valign="top">great dog-in-winter shot.  The composition is action filled - where he (she?) has been, where he is , where he is going, then the capture of him mid stride, almost in flight anchors it all.  You could crop in on the left and a tad on the right and gain some impact and focus (thematically) 8</td>', 'great dog-in-winter shot.  The composition is action filled - where he (she?) has been, where he is , where he is going, then the capture of him mid stride, almost in flight anchors it all.  You could crop in on the left and a tad on the right and gain some impact and focus (thematically) 8', '2004-01-25 17:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(556442, 56655, 7628, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  This looks familiar.  Isn;t this the picture that started it all?  Nice dragon, nice shadow.  Wish the light on the botttom right weren''t so bright - the detail is a bit blown out.  The contrast and detail in the dragon is good, wish the shadow were a bit darker.  You could create more impact with some selective adjustments.  And thanks for getting the chionese zodiac idea started, this is fun!<br/></td>', 'Hmm.  This looks familiar.  Isn;t this the picture that started it all?  Nice dragon, nice shadow.  Wish the light on the botttom right weren''t so bright - the detail is a bit blown out.  The contrast and detail in the dragon is good, wish the shadow were a bit darker.  You could create more impact with some selective adjustments.  And thanks for getting the chionese zodiac idea started, this is fun!', '2004-01-25 17:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(556443, 56686, 7628, '<td valign="top">intriguing.  I like the refection idea.  I like all the white, and how the eyes stands out, but I would like to see a bit more detail or contrast in the fur and eyelashes.</td>', 'intriguing.  I like the refection idea.  I like all the white, and how the eyes stands out, but I would like to see a bit more detail or contrast in the fur and eyelashes.', '2004-01-25 18:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(556447, 56588, 7628, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The eyes really glow.  Dramatic composition, boosts the illusion. The lighting is great - very transforming.  It is just a bit bright -blownout between the corner of the mouth and the cheek. The color of the light is a bit yellow - how would it look if you desaturated the face a bit, might seem a bit more reptilian?  Might darken up the material beneath the chin it ditracts the eye a bit.</td>', 'Well done.  The eyes really glow.  Dramatic composition, boosts the illusion. The lighting is great - very transforming.  It is just a bit bright -blownout between the corner of the mouth and the cheek. The color of the light is a bit yellow - how would it look if you desaturated the face a bit, might seem a bit more reptilian?  Might darken up the material beneath the chin it ditracts the eye a bit.', '2004-01-25 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(556494, 56608, 13749, '<td valign="top">beautiful tones and composition - nice choice of black &amp; white - my fav of the challenge</td>', 'beautiful tones and composition - nice choice of black & white - my fav of the challenge', '2004-01-25 19:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(556505, 56701, 7556, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful picture, really brings the feel of a chinese new year...10</td>', 'Nice colorful picture, really brings the feel of a chinese new year...10', '2004-01-25 19:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(556508, 56654, 7556, '<td valign="top">Nice looking dog, I like the blue sky and the cat tails in the background...10</td>', 'Nice looking dog, I like the blue sky and the cat tails in the background...10', '2004-01-25 19:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(556514, 56638, 7556, '<td valign="top">Nice freeze action shot...10</td>', 'Nice freeze action shot...10', '2004-01-25 19:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(556515, 56608, 7556, '<td valign="top">Looks good in B/W...nice shot...10</td>', 'Looks good in B/W...nice shot...10', '2004-01-25 19:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(556519, 56718, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not really sure the background works for my here.  I think I would like to see all one color for the background.  I like the addition of the oriental letters.  Kind of makes it tie in with the whole "chinese" zodiac theme, although I have no clue what it says or even what language it is.  Your focus on the bunny is good, and Lighting is good, although there is a bit of a distracting shadow from the bunny on the darker 1/2 of the background.  Overall good though.</td>', 'Not really sure the background works for my here.  I think I would like to see all one color for the background.  I like the addition of the oriental letters.  Kind of makes it tie in with the whole "chinese" zodiac theme, although I have no clue what it says or even what language it is.  Your focus on the bunny is good, and Lighting is good, although there is a bit of a distracting shadow from the bunny on the darker 1/2 of the background.  Overall good though.', '2004-01-25 19:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(556530, 56737, 6668, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, love the background, frame works well with this photo as well...nicely done. 10</td>', 'Nice composition, love the background, frame works well with this photo as well...nicely done. 10', '2004-01-25 20:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(556532, 56694, 6668, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and colors...nicely done. 9</td>', 'Very nice composition and colors...nicely done. 9', '2004-01-25 20:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(556539, 56705, 6668, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of the dogs face.</td>', 'I would like to see more of the dogs face.', '2004-01-25 20:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(556541, 56702, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, super sharp, maybe a bit too tight of a crop. Great colors, great shot. Good job.</td>', 'Nice DOF, super sharp, maybe a bit too tight of a crop. Great colors, great shot. Good job.', '2004-01-25 20:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(556579, 56684, 14700, '<td valign="top">Its good to see a well done product shot.</td>', 'Its good to see a well done product shot.', '2004-01-25 21:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(556581, 56495, 14700, '<td valign="top">A good macro pic is hard to find on this site.... Especially of somthing alive!  Nice job.  I wish I could vote, I''d give you a 9.  I kinda think a black background would have been a dramatic contrast.</td>', 'A good macro pic is hard to find on this site.... Especially of somthing alive!  Nice job.  I wish I could vote, I''d give you a 9.  I kinda think a black background would have been a dramatic contrast.', '2004-01-25 21:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(556583, 56686, 14700, '<td valign="top">I wish I could vote!  This is an 8 or 9.  I love the narrow plane of focus.  It really draws you in. Nice reflection in the eye.  I hope people don''t flip through too fast.</td>', 'I wish I could vote!  This is an 8 or 9.  I love the narrow plane of focus.  It really draws you in. Nice reflection in the eye.  I hope people don''t flip through too fast.', '2004-01-25 21:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(556584, 56590, 14700, '<td valign="top">A well done product shot.  Nice hard-light.</td>', 'A well done product shot.  Nice hard-light.', '2004-01-25 21:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(556601, 56727, 6668, '<td valign="top">cute idea, but the monkeys seem a bit overexposed to me.</td>', 'cute idea, but the monkeys seem a bit overexposed to me.', '2004-01-25 21:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(556603, 56669, 6668, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the bunny looking more at the camera, but that is just my opinion.</td>', 'I would like to see the bunny looking more at the camera, but that is just my opinion.', '2004-01-25 21:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(556607, 56672, 6668, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot...love the use of black and white, hope to see this one in the top three.  10 from me!</td>', 'Outstanding shot...love the use of black and white, hope to see this one in the top three.  10 from me!', '2004-01-25 21:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(556626, 56561, 327, '<td valign="top">I like the treatment, noise and light. Neat shot.</td>', 'I like the treatment, noise and light. Neat shot.', '2004-01-25 22:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(556627, 56683, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice looking dog.</td>', 'Nice looking dog.', '2004-01-25 22:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(556628, 56752, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the light.</td>', 'Love the light.', '2004-01-25 22:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(556629, 56621, 327, '<td valign="top">So cute!!!! lol Great color.</td>', 'So cute!!!! lol Great color.', '2004-01-25 22:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(556632, 56635, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, I can''t help but wonder ..if it was cropped the other direction?</td>', 'Lovely shot, I can''t help but wonder ..if it was cropped the other direction?', '2004-01-25 22:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(556636, 56702, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the light and color intensity.</td>', 'Love the light and color intensity.', '2004-01-25 22:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(556637, 56701, 327, '<td valign="top">Kool shot.</td>', 'Kool shot.', '2004-01-25 22:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(556639, 56654, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pose....full attention.</td>', 'Wonderful pose....full attention.', '2004-01-25 22:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(556642, 56629, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow, just great light and focus. Sweet shot.</td>', 'Wow, just great light and focus. Sweet shot.', '2004-01-25 22:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(556689, 56686, 9073, '<td valign="top">I can see where you''re going with this one. However, for the image to really work, you need to lighten the image in the eye a touch more. 5</td>', 'I can see where you''re going with this one. However, for the image to really work, you need to lighten the image in the eye a touch more. 5', '2004-01-25 23:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(556693, 56635, 9073, '<td valign="top">This has a nice touch. Very subtle. I''m not happy with the border, though. I''m a border fan, but here its heaviness detracts from the gentle tracks of the rabbit. 6</td>', 'This has a nice touch. Very subtle. I''m not happy with the border, though. I''m a border fan, but here its heaviness detracts from the gentle tracks of the rabbit. 6', '2004-01-25 23:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(556705, 56718, 9073, '<td valign="top">I really like the obviously ''designed'' aspect of this shot. The colour choice is effective and helps make the shot very elegant. However, I just wish that the font you used wasn''t so pixelated. Kudos on making the rabbit look at his character. 6</td>', 'I really like the obviously ''designed'' aspect of this shot. The colour choice is effective and helps make the shot very elegant. However, I just wish that the font you used wasn''t so pixelated. Kudos on making the rabbit look at his character. 6', '2004-01-25 23:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(556711, 56737, 9073, '<td valign="top">The detail has been created by highlights rather than from the colour of the object. This makes it difficult to look at, for me. Nice idea, though. 5</td>', 'The detail has been created by highlights rather than from the colour of the object. This makes it difficult to look at, for me. Nice idea, though. 5', '2004-01-25 23:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(556716, 56482, 9073, '<td valign="top">Although this shot has been very nicely orchestrated, I find the effect a bit dull. Sorry. The texture, composition, subject and camera angle are all good. Just not my taste. 5</td>', 'Although this shot has been very nicely orchestrated, I find the effect a bit dull. Sorry. The texture, composition, subject and camera angle are all good. Just not my taste. 5', '2004-01-25 23:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(556719, 56655, 9073, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea and a very effective composition. 2 negative points - the blowout on the bottom right and the head is underexposed. Also, the shadow would have been more effective if it had been darker. 6</td>', 'Lovely idea and a very effective composition. 2 negative points - the blowout on the bottom right and the head is underexposed. Also, the shadow would have been more effective if it had been darker. 6', '2004-01-25 23:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(556723, 56590, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nicely crafted piece. I like that you''ve given more room on the left and top. Just a bit bland, though. 6</td>', 'Nicely crafted piece. I like that you''ve given more room on the left and top. Just a bit bland, though. 6', '2004-01-25 23:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(556725, 56687, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and an effective subject. Maybe a shallower dof would have helped distance the subject from the rather bland background, though. 6</td>', 'Nice composition and an effective subject. Maybe a shallower dof would have helped distance the subject from the rather bland background, though. 6', '2004-01-25 23:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(556732, 56694, 9073, '<td valign="top">I like the wb, tinting the clouds with the red of the fire breath. A nice touch. I wonder, though, if a deep dof wouldn''t have helped, as I feel that the clouds needed to be a touch more in focus, less bokeh. 6</td>', 'I like the wb, tinting the clouds with the red of the fire breath. A nice touch. I wonder, though, if a deep dof wouldn''t have helped, as I feel that the clouds needed to be a touch more in focus, less bokeh. 6', '2004-01-25 23:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(556747, 56662, 6504, '<td valign="top">This is GREAT!!!  How in the world did you get them all jumping at the same time!!?</td>', 'This is GREAT!!!  How in the world did you get them all jumping at the same time!!?', '2004-01-25 23:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(556750, 56530, 6504, '<td valign="top">Oh, yes!!! You are the winner!!!</td>', 'Oh, yes!!! You are the winner!!!', '2004-01-25 23:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(556751, 56734, 9073, '<td valign="top">Cute. The centring makes for a bland shot here. If this chubby chappie were further to the right, the overall balance would be better, imho. The colours look a little off, too. Sorry. 4</td>', 'Cute. The centring makes for a bland shot here. If this chubby chappie were further to the right, the overall balance would be better, imho. The colours look a little off, too. Sorry. 4', '2004-01-25 23:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(556753, 56654, 6504, '<td valign="top">This gets the prize for most original, creative.  Beautiful dog, nice colors, composure.   Excellent.</td>', 'This gets the prize for most original, creative.  Beautiful dog, nice colors, composure.   Excellent.', '2004-01-25 23:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(556754, 56702, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beauty!!! the colors are outstanding.  The eyes are particularly captivating.  Very good photo.  Perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'Beauty!!! the colors are outstanding.  The eyes are particularly captivating.  Very good photo.  Perfect for the challenge.', '2004-01-25 23:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(556756, 56613, 9073, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. (An outtake for the NG challenge?) Lovely bokeh. Sharp details. Spotless. Not my taste, but the sheer excellence of the capture is making me give a high score. 9</td>', 'Lovely shot. (An outtake for the NG challenge?) Lovely bokeh. Sharp details. Spotless. Not my taste, but the sheer excellence of the capture is making me give a high score. 9', '2004-01-25 23:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(556762, 56662, 9073, '<td valign="top">This would have been so, so good had the focal point been on the pigs themselves, not the fence behind them. Too bad. 3</td>', 'This would have been so, so good had the focal point been on the pigs themselves, not the fence behind them. Too bad. 3', '2004-01-25 23:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(556763, 56730, 9073, '<td valign="top">The jpeg artifact problem you''ve got here, caused by overcompression, is ruining this shot. Sorry. 2</td>', 'The jpeg artifact problem you''ve got here, caused by overcompression, is ruining this shot. Sorry. 2', '2004-01-25 23:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(556764, 56608, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  Good composition, B&amp;W is perfect for this.  I like the contrast between the sheep and the grass.  Well Done!</td>', 'This is a great shot.  Good composition, B&W is perfect for this.  I like the contrast between the sheep and the grass.  Well Done!', '2004-01-25 23:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(556766, 56608, 9073, '<td valign="top">Hehe. I like this one. Cute, well-taken, appropriate for the challenge. The grass, however, creates an overall dark tone. I think that the feeling here should be lighter, to match the mood. 7</td>', 'Hehe. I like this one. Cute, well-taken, appropriate for the challenge. The grass, however, creates an overall dark tone. I think that the feeling here should be lighter, to match the mood. 7', '2004-01-25 23:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(556772, 56672, 14620, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  This screams chinese zodiac to me.  Great tones and compostion!  Background is just a little busy... who had to go a build a bridge right there in the middle of your perfect picture! :-)  But not much you could''ve done about that.  Great shot!<br/></td>', 'Fantastic!  This screams chinese zodiac to me.  Great tones and compostion!  Background is just a little busy... who had to go a build a bridge right there in the middle of your perfect picture! :-)  But not much you could''ve done about that.  Great shot!', '2004-01-25 23:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(556780, 56611, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very cool and unique shot for this challenge.  I''ll assume the symbol stands for dragon based on your title (since I haven''t masterd the chinese language yet) :-)<br/>I really like this, the lighting is good as well as the composition.</td>', 'Very cool and unique shot for this challenge.  I''ll assume the symbol stands for dragon based on your title (since I haven''t masterd the chinese language yet) :-)I really like this, the lighting is good as well as the composition.', '2004-01-25 23:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(556781, 56662, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!  Great humor here!  I really like how you captured them all airborne at the same time.  This is so cute!  Thanks for the laugh! :)</td>', 'This is hilarious!  Great humor here!  I really like how you captured them all airborne at the same time.  This is so cute!  Thanks for the laugh! :)', '2004-01-25 23:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(556782, 56746, 9073, '<td valign="top">This potentially great shot suffers from 2 problems, I feel. 1 - oversharpening. I feel dazzled by the white. 2 - the border adds nothing, I think, and I''m a border freak. 4</td>', 'This potentially great shot suffers from 2 problems, I feel. 1 - oversharpening. I feel dazzled by the white. 2 - the border adds nothing, I think, and I''m a border freak. 4', '2004-01-25 23:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
