(557026, 56745, 16188, '<td valign="top">Wow, was it snowing!?  Amazing!  The colors are great and I was hoping someone would be able to come up with a Chinese New Year shot of a dragon.  This is a nice one.  The only weaknesses are in the sharpness category (especially where the dragon''s head is slightly out of focus except for the lower part (tongue down to beard).</td>', 'Wow, was it snowing!?  Amazing!  The colors are great and I was hoping someone would be able to come up with a Chinese New Year shot of a dragon.  This is a nice one.  The only weaknesses are in the sharpness category (especially where the dragon''s head is slightly out of focus except for the lower part (tongue down to beard).', '2004-01-26 02:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(557027, 56694, 16188, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, pretty good execution.  I love how the statuette loses all sense of its real size in this composition.  I can''t make out the head of the dragon very well for some reason and that''s frustrating.  I love the colors.</td>', 'Nice idea, pretty good execution.  I love how the statuette loses all sense of its real size in this composition.  I can''t make out the head of the dragon very well for some reason and that''s frustrating.  I love the colors.', '2004-01-26 02:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
