(557072, 56672, 16188, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s geat.  Especially like it''s in black and white because the ''stars''/lights shine all the more brightly and evocatively this way.</td>', 'Wow, that''s geat.  Especially like it''s in black and white because the ''stars''/lights shine all the more brightly and evocatively this way.', '2004-01-26 02:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(557073, 56704, 16188, '<td valign="top">Focusing on the bit like this really detracts from the Year of the Horse theme for me.</td>', 'Focusing on the bit like this really detracts from the Year of the Horse theme for me.', '2004-01-26 02:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(557075, 56568, 16188, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and the sepia is great.  The carcasses in the background take away from the theme, though, since the Ox is about abundance and having enough to eat.</td>', 'Nice shot and the sepia is great.  The carcasses in the background take away from the theme, though, since the Ox is about abundance and having enough to eat.', '2004-01-26 02:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(557076, 56718, 16188, '<td valign="top">Nice layout graphically.  The jaggies are distracting on the characters and that the ''year'' character is cut off at the top.  But, I like the texture of the rabbit against the backdrop.</td>', 'Nice layout graphically.  The jaggies are distracting on the characters and that the ''year'' character is cut off at the top.  But, I like the texture of the rabbit against the backdrop.', '2004-01-26 02:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(557077, 56590, 16188, '<td valign="top">Nicely done as a photograph.  The horse as beast of burden doesn''t go to well with the theme, though.</td>', 'Nicely done as a photograph.  The horse as beast of burden doesn''t go to well with the theme, though.', '2004-01-26 02:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(557078, 56669, 16188, '<td valign="top">Woo!  Another contortionist shot!  :)  Blends into the background a lot.</td>', 'Woo!  Another contortionist shot!  :)  Blends into the background a lot.', '2004-01-26 02:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(557163, 56495, 9073, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, bad title. 8</td>', 'Nice shot, bad title. 8', '2004-01-26 03:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(557188, 56553, 9073, '<td valign="top">I don'' t know how you did this, but I like it, it''s fun. 8</td>', 'I don'' t know how you did this, but I like it, it''s fun. 8', '2004-01-26 03:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(557301, 56720, 13749, '<td valign="top">seems slightly tilted to the left, but a good idea.  considering the setting, it might have been nice to eliminate the shadow with a little lighting from the right.</td>', 'seems slightly tilted to the left, but a good idea.  considering the setting, it might have been nice to eliminate the shadow with a little lighting from the right.', '2004-01-26 04:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(557303, 56540, 13749, '<td valign="top">nice find, creative intepretation &amp; expression.</td>', 'nice find, creative intepretation & expression.', '2004-01-26 04:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(557304, 56734, 13749, '<td valign="top">looks like the little roller skating pig i saw in a challenge not too long ago (transportation?).  color cast seems a bit yellow, but maybe it''s me.</td>', 'looks like the little roller skating pig i saw in a challenge not too long ago (transportation?).  color cast seems a bit yellow, but maybe it''s me.', '2004-01-26 04:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(557332, 56702, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  From what I''ve seen, you''ve got yourself a ribbon.  And probably a blue one at that.  Great color and clarity.  Looks like  a winner to me - 9</td>', 'Excellent shot.  From what I''ve seen, you''ve got yourself a ribbon.  And probably a blue one at that.  Great color and clarity.  Looks like  a winner to me - 9', '2004-01-26 05:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(557333, 56717, 3540, '<td valign="top">Reds are a little oversaturated.  Amazingly, its too red.  Good clear shot besides that though.  And one of the better ones of this challenge to boot</td>', 'Reds are a little oversaturated.  Amazingly, its too red.  Good clear shot besides that though.  And one of the better ones of this challenge to boot', '2004-01-26 05:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(557341, 56482, 8139, '<td valign="top">I like this framing.</td>', 'I like this framing.', '2004-01-26 06:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(557342, 56530, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice model, and interesting post processing</td>', 'Nice model, and interesting post processing', '2004-01-26 06:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(557344, 56608, 8139, '<td valign="top">Top quality B/W . I love sheeps when they watch you.<br/>EDIT: One of my favorites. 10</td>', 'Top quality B/W . I love sheeps when they watch you.EDIT: One of my favorites. 10', '2004-01-26 06:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(557345, 56702, 8139, '<td valign="top">This one is very well done. Expressive, good use of DOF<br/>EDIT: one of my favs. 10</td>', 'This one is very well done. Expressive, good use of DOFEDIT: one of my favs. 10', '2004-01-26 06:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(557346, 56638, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot. I like the snow lighting  too. Maybe the dog would not be so centered?</td>', 'Nice action shot. I like the snow lighting  too. Maybe the dog would not be so centered?', '2004-01-26 06:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(557347, 56752, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and use of DOF.</td>', 'Nice lighting and use of DOF.', '2004-01-26 06:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(557363, 56676, 3540, '<td valign="top">Shutter looks just a little slow to really get this guy frozen.  The picture is just the slightest bit soft.  Good composition and I really like the framing of this little guy.  Good work 7</td>', 'Shutter looks just a little slow to really get this guy frozen.  The picture is just the slightest bit soft.  Good composition and I really like the framing of this little guy.  Good work 7', '2004-01-26 06:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(557370, 56564, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool Blue eyes on a horse.  Can''t say I''ve ever seen a brown horse with blue eyes.  The photo is just a bit soft.  Especially around the mouth.  Pretty good composition and framing though.</td>', 'Cool Blue eyes on a horse.  Can''t say I''ve ever seen a brown horse with blue eyes.  The photo is just a bit soft.  Especially around the mouth.  Pretty good composition and framing though.', '2004-01-26 06:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(557373, 56531, 3540, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s bright.  Maybe too bright for this picture.  The dragon is plenty bright enough for this photo.  THe yellow background dominates him.</td>', 'Wow, that''s bright.  Maybe too bright for this picture.  The dragon is plenty bright enough for this photo.  THe yellow background dominates him.', '2004-01-26 06:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(557375, 56737, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the background.  I think you should''ve lit this guy from underneath.  It would have made him look a little more sinister.  Good subject, just the lighting on him isn''t quite where I think it should be and probably could be just a little brighter.</td>', 'I like the background.  I think you should''ve lit this guy from underneath.  It would have made him look a little more sinister.  Good subject, just the lighting on him isn''t quite where I think it should be and probably could be just a little brighter.', '2004-01-26 07:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(557378, 56621, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good crisp clear pic and a very cute rabbit.  He''s well lit and well exposed.  Not sure if the background really works for him, but it sure doesn''t work against him.  Good job 8</td>', 'Good crisp clear pic and a very cute rabbit.  He''s well lit and well exposed.  Not sure if the background really works for him, but it sure doesn''t work against him.  Good job 8', '2004-01-26 07:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(557384, 56746, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good colorful picture.  Nice and sharp... maybe too sharp.  It has that oversharpened look to it.  Good subject though.  A good friend of mine has one of these.</td>', 'Good colorful picture.  Nice and sharp... maybe too sharp.  It has that oversharpened look to it.  Good subject though.  A good friend of mine has one of these.', '2004-01-26 07:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(557489, 56590, 16352, '<td valign="top">I do like this. I had to photograph something like this many years ago.for an auctioneer. One point. As the background is black I would have just put the smallest (and I do mean smallest) amount of light to the left, rear. That would just give the very slightest amount of shape to parts which merge into the background and give just the smallest amount of detail into the figure.</td>', 'I do like this. I had to photograph something like this many years ago.for an auctioneer. One point. As the background is black I would have just put the smallest (and I do mean smallest) amount of light to the left, rear. That would just give the very slightest amount of shape to parts which merge into the background and give just the smallest amount of detail into the figure.', '2004-01-26 09:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(557494, 56629, 16352, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog from an unusual angle - such a shame there is no catchlight in the eye - put a white dot on in an editor and see how it lifts it (I know you cant do that for the competition entry). The one thing that appears to let it down is the cut-out (It appears to be cut-out, apologies if I am wrong). Fur - hair - feathers - trees are almost impossible to get to look convincing. Great dog though.</td>', 'Beautiful dog from an unusual angle - such a shame there is no catchlight in the eye - put a white dot on in an editor and see how it lifts it (I know you cant do that for the competition entry). The one thing that appears to let it down is the cut-out (It appears to be cut-out, apologies if I am wrong). Fur - hair - feathers - trees are almost impossible to get to look convincing. Great dog though.', '2004-01-26 09:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(557498, 56538, 16493, '<td valign="top">no connection</td>', 'no connection', '2004-01-26 09:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(557500, 56532, 16493, '<td valign="top">don''t like thw washed out color</td>', 'don''t like thw washed out color', '2004-01-26 09:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(557548, 56482, 16352, '<td valign="top">Nice shades - and I like the black contrasting to the right. I would have cropped out just below the nostrils though. I find the feed remnants distracting.</td>', 'Nice shades - and I like the black contrasting to the right. I would have cropped out just below the nostrils though. I find the feed remnants distracting.', '2004-01-26 10:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(557556, 56531, 16352, '<td valign="top">Like the subject but I feel the background clashes and washes out the beautiful colours of the dragon. Not sure if the bacground was difficult to cut it out from but it looks a bit hard.</td>', 'Like the subject but I feel the background clashes and washes out the beautiful colours of the dragon. Not sure if the bacground was difficult to cut it out from but it looks a bit hard.', '2004-01-26 10:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(557561, 56506, 16352, '<td valign="top">Totally beautiful dog. Interesting composition but a sheet on the floor or a plain carpet would have "pulled" the dog to the fore. I have just cropped to the left of the dogs nose and it is a beautiful picture then.</td>', 'Totally beautiful dog. Interesting composition but a sheet on the floor or a plain carpet would have "pulled" the dog to the fore. I have just cropped to the left of the dogs nose and it is a beautiful picture then.', '2004-01-26 10:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(557617, 56490, 16352, '<td valign="top">The vivid colours are great but there is something that does not work at all for me. I think that as this could very definately be considered "art" rather than a photograph I think it is going to be either an "I love it" or I hate it. I find the texture of the background disturbing. If it had been solid black I think that would help (for me). HOWEVER - The picture has intrigued me enough for me to want to look at more of your pictures - and so in that case it has worked! Apologies for the lower mark on this one but I am glad I want to look at more of your work</td>', 'The vivid colours are great but there is something that does not work at all for me. I think that as this could very definately be considered "art" rather than a photograph I think it is going to be either an "I love it" or I hate it. I find the texture of the background disturbing. If it had been solid black I think that would help (for me). HOWEVER - The picture has intrigued me enough for me to want to look at more of your pictures - and so in that case it has worked! Apologies for the lower mark on this one but I am glad I want to look at more of your work', '2004-01-26 11:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(557625, 56557, 16352, '<td valign="top">Interesting but I find the Spike shadows disruptive. Everything else is curved/rounded but the spikey shadows do not appear to come from anything connected. He does have a creepy sort of face. In photoshop I dodged the left of the picture and got rid of the shadow (I know you can''t for the competition) and it transformed him into a real evil character.</td>', 'Interesting but I find the Spike shadows disruptive. Everything else is curved/rounded but the spikey shadows do not appear to come from anything connected. He does have a creepy sort of face. In photoshop I dodged the left of the picture and got rid of the shadow (I know you can''t for the competition) and it transformed him into a real evil character.', '2004-01-26 11:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(557632, 56717, 16352, '<td valign="top">Nice colour saturation - I would have cropped the top closer to his head to tighten it up.</td>', 'Nice colour saturation - I would have cropped the top closer to his head to tighten it up.', '2004-01-26 11:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(557636, 56493, 16352, '<td valign="top">I found myself looking at the cluttered background too much - A piece of tissue paper over the flash would have helped diffuse the light a little and would have eased the burned out centre. It is exceptionally hard to get a good picture of a black and white animal like this.</td>', 'I found myself looking at the cluttered background too much - A piece of tissue paper over the flash would have helped diffuse the light a little and would have eased the burned out centre. It is exceptionally hard to get a good picture of a black and white animal like this.', '2004-01-26 11:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(557643, 56611, 16352, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this is going to be one of those pictures that gets the "does it fit into the category" comment. I like it though - very much. The only crit is the burned out area above the eye. It may not be like that on the original so apologies if it isnt. Therefore 7 not an 8. I think it is an interesting use of the  symbol (assume it is the symbol for dragon). Shame the face is not a tad more oriental looking.</td>', 'I wonder if this is going to be one of those pictures that gets the "does it fit into the category" comment. I like it though - very much. The only crit is the burned out area above the eye. It may not be like that on the original so apologies if it isnt. Therefore 7 not an 8. I think it is an interesting use of the  symbol (assume it is the symbol for dragon). Shame the face is not a tad more oriental looking.', '2004-01-26 11:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(557646, 56462, 16352, '<td valign="top">As this was appearing on the screen I liked it until the teeth appeared so burned out.  Good directional lighting (like 30''s Hollywood) giving the "evil" look but the catchlights and reflections are a bit harsh. Reflecting the light off a gold reflector may have help - it may have even have emphasised the orange of the face.</td>', 'As this was appearing on the screen I liked it until the teeth appeared so burned out.  Good directional lighting (like 30''s Hollywood) giving the "evil" look but the catchlights and reflections are a bit harsh. Reflecting the light off a gold reflector may have help - it may have even have emphasised the orange of the face.', '2004-01-26 11:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(557649, 56687, 16352, '<td valign="top">Such a shame that the snow burned out so much.  Very difficult shot to get away with unless you meter from the right place. I guess you metered from the animal. If you can with your camera - thiswould have been one of those to use grey card on. Of course if yours is fully automatic then that would be impossible and in that case cropping it differently would help eliminate the problem but still leave some snow. If you want - I will email you a jpg of how I would crop it.</td>', 'Such a shame that the snow burned out so much.  Very difficult shot to get away with unless you meter from the right place. I guess you metered from the animal. If you can with your camera - thiswould have been one of those to use grey card on. Of course if yours is fully automatic then that would be impossible and in that case cropping it differently would help eliminate the problem but still leave some snow. If you want - I will email you a jpg of how I would crop it.', '2004-01-26 11:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(557652, 56562, 16352, '<td valign="top">One thing, for me, has spoiled this picture and it would be easy to put it right. This very funny monkey has a great texture. It makes what could have been an ordinary soft toy "special" BUT the background which has the right colour to bring out his colour is too shiny. It is competing with his "sparkliness/glitter". Such a small thing. Try reshooting it with a similar colour cloth but non-reflective. I hope you think it makes a difference</td>', 'One thing, for me, has spoiled this picture and it would be easy to put it right. This very funny monkey has a great texture. It makes what could have been an ordinary soft toy "special" BUT the background which has the right colour to bring out his colour is too shiny. It is competing with his "sparkliness/glitter". Such a small thing. Try reshooting it with a similar colour cloth but non-reflective. I hope you think it makes a difference', '2004-01-26 11:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(557663, 56540, 16352, '<td valign="top">As this was appearing I was thing - Yes - Brilliant - something a bit different. I love the idea but I don''t think the shape is quite near enough. I am glad though that someone did at least think a bit more out of the box and as it''s a good shape and interesting I still go with a 7</td>', 'As this was appearing I was thing - Yes - Brilliant - something a bit different. I love the idea but I don''t think the shape is quite near enough. I am glad though that someone did at least think a bit more out of the box and as it''s a good shape and interesting I still go with a 7', '2004-01-26 11:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(557675, 56553, 16352, '<td valign="top">Nearly, but the top of the head is burned out and the face and body seem to merge into blackness. I do like him and it makes me laugh. As you have a digital camera - even if you do not have proper studio lights - a spotlight pointing lower left may have pulled out a little detail</td>', 'Nearly, but the top of the head is burned out and the face and body seem to merge into blackness. I do like him and it makes me laugh. As you have a digital camera - even if you do not have proper studio lights - a spotlight pointing lower left may have pulled out a little detail', '2004-01-26 11:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(557676, 56720, 16352, '<td valign="top">At last - originality - and for that alone 7</td>', 'At last - originality - and for that alone 7', '2004-01-26 11:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(557698, 56622, 10705, '<td valign="top">Very cute !!</td>', 'Very cute !!', '2004-01-26 12:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(557704, 56495, 10705, '<td valign="top">Nice profile, very sharp focus...nice.</td>', 'Nice profile, very sharp focus...nice.', '2004-01-26 12:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(557711, 56506, 10705, '<td valign="top">Very nice expression on the dog''s face, but I think the pig in the background detracts just a little, even tho the title fits.  Also, the thing that looks like a pencil pointing to the pig is distracting.  I think the dog''s face could have stood alone and made a terrific photo!</td>', 'Very nice expression on the dog''s face, but I think the pig in the background detracts just a little, even tho the title fits.  Also, the thing that looks like a pencil pointing to the pig is distracting.  I think the dog''s face could have stood alone and made a terrific photo!', '2004-01-26 12:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(557712, 56512, 10705, '<td valign="top">too cute!</td>', 'too cute!', '2004-01-26 12:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(557714, 56608, 10705, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is perfect ... terrific composition ... love the placement of the sheep.  Very nice.</td>', 'B&W is perfect ... terrific composition ... love the placement of the sheep.  Very nice.', '2004-01-26 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(557715, 56745, 10705, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nice composition, but focus is a little too soft.</td>', 'Great colors, nice composition, but focus is a little too soft.', '2004-01-26 12:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(557720, 56717, 10705, '<td valign="top">I really like the bright red, and yellow beak against the dull background ... very nice composition...really makes him stand out!</td>', 'I really like the bright red, and yellow beak against the dull background ... very nice composition...really makes him stand out!', '2004-01-26 12:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(557725, 56545, 10705, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the way you''ve set this up with the flame.  Very creative and nice!</td>', 'Love the colors and the way you''ve set this up with the flame.  Very creative and nice!', '2004-01-26 12:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(557726, 56702, 10705, '<td valign="top">Excellent color and clarity... very nice photo!</td>', 'Excellent color and clarity... very nice photo!', '2004-01-26 12:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(557729, 56638, 10705, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot!</td>', 'Nice action shot!', '2004-01-26 12:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(557733, 56654, 10705, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous dog, nice portrait</td>', 'Gorgeous dog, nice portrait', '2004-01-26 12:27:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(557736, 56699, 10705, '<td valign="top">The gold in the eye matches the background color, which draws my attention to the eye ... very nice job.  Only thing that I think would make this better is if the tongue were sticking out, but you tell that to the snake!!!  "8"</td>', 'The gold in the eye matches the background color, which draws my attention to the eye ... very nice job.  Only thing that I think would make this better is if the tongue were sticking out, but you tell that to the snake!!!  "8"', '2004-01-26 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(557737, 56591, 10705, '<td valign="top">Terrific lighting ... very nice.</td>', 'Terrific lighting ... very nice.', '2004-01-26 12:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(557740, 56662, 10705, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft, but what I really like about this photo is the sequence of running ... each pig is in a different stage.  I think this is a really nice capture!</td>', 'Focus is a little soft, but what I really like about this photo is the sequence of running ... each pig is in a different stage.  I think this is a really nice capture!', '2004-01-26 12:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(557815, 56613, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Good shallow dof.</td>', 'Nice photo. Good shallow dof.', '2004-01-26 13:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(557922, 56677, 16352, '<td valign="top">Forgive me if I am wrong - but have you just taken a picture of a drawing. Is the picture yours? Are their copyright implications?<br/>It is a very good, well lit, evenly exposed photograph and is surprisingly difficult to do but I am not sure of its relevance. If you are the artist it is brilliant and you should be getting paid for your art but because of the ambiguity I will have to mark low but please accept my apologies if I am totally wrong.</td>', 'Forgive me if I am wrong - but have you just taken a picture of a drawing. Is the picture yours? Are their copyright implications?It is a very good, well lit, evenly exposed photograph and is surprisingly difficult to do but I am not sure of its relevance. If you are the artist it is brilliant and you should be getting paid for your art but because of the ambiguity I will have to mark low but please accept my apologies if I am totally wrong.', '2004-01-26 14:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(557938, 56635, 10047, '<td valign="top">Clever shot and really well done. Nice clarity and composition.</td>', 'Clever shot and really well done. Nice clarity and composition.', '2004-01-26 14:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(557943, 56530, 10047, '<td valign="top">Don''t normally like the shots where only the subject is saturated, but it works well here.</td>', 'Don''t normally like the shots where only the subject is saturated, but it works well here.', '2004-01-26 14:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(557955, 56530, 8367, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of a beautiful  horse/yearling? I love the background effect and the pose, but  I find the very white rail in the foreground to be  distracting. Color it gray and the photo would be awesome.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of a beautiful  horse/yearling? I love the background effect and the pose, but  I find the very white rail in the foreground to be  distracting. Color it gray and the photo would be awesome.', '2004-01-26 14:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(557958, 56665, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great subject. I like the composition and your background.  It needs a little more space around the subject, though.</td>', 'Great subject. I like the composition and your background.  It needs a little more space around the subject, though.', '2004-01-26 14:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(558013, 56532, 13336, '<td valign="top">less photoshop, more photo....<br/> <br/>i don''t mean to sound harsh, but this just isn''t a photograph anymore, and for whatever it is, it just isn''t all that appealing.  trust in the image...</td>', 'less photoshop, more photo.... i don''t mean to sound harsh, but this just isn''t a photograph anymore, and for whatever it is, it just isn''t all that appealing.  trust in the image...', '2004-01-26 16:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(558018, 56727, 13336, '<td valign="top">cool arrangement, but a little oversaturated i think.  kind of hard to look at.  and while the arrangement is cool, you left a big gap between to of the monkeys at the bottom, which throws it all off...</td>', 'cool arrangement, but a little oversaturated i think.  kind of hard to look at.  and while the arrangement is cool, you left a big gap between to of the monkeys at the bottom, which throws it all off...', '2004-01-26 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(558089, 56655, 16052, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow effect. A bit hot in lower right corner.</td>', 'Nice shadow effect. A bit hot in lower right corner.', '2004-01-26 17:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(558148, 56506, 10720, '<td valign="top">love the dog''s expressive eyes and the placement, but find the rug background very distracting, and the chopstick drawing my attention away from the dog.</td>', 'love the dog''s expressive eyes and the placement, but find the rug background very distracting, and the chopstick drawing my attention away from the dog.', '2004-01-26 17:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(558149, 56654, 10720, '<td valign="top">Love the title, and fits the theme, wish the dogs eyes has some highlight, they seem to be in shadow.</td>', 'Love the title, and fits the theme, wish the dogs eyes has some highlight, they seem to be in shadow.', '2004-01-26 17:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(558150, 56676, 10720, '<td valign="top">I love this little fellow and his expression. Dead on the theme. The light seems to be a bit green, not sure about the color balance on him.</td>', 'I love this little fellow and his expression. Dead on the theme. The light seems to be a bit green, not sure about the color balance on him.', '2004-01-26 17:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(558156, 56588, 10720, '<td valign="top">Great job doing the digital effects and staying within the rules (already see the photo has been validated) one of the more unique interpretations of the theme. I find it works very well for me.</td>', 'Great job doing the digital effects and staying within the rules (already see the photo has been validated) one of the more unique interpretations of the theme. I find it works very well for me.', '2004-01-26 17:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
