(558966, 56608, 9295, '<td valign="top">I love this entry into the Chinese Zodiac challenge.  Very very well done.  You captured these guys (gals?) at the perfect moment and I love your choice to keep the photo in black and white.  I can''t give you a score, but if I could, it would surely be at least a 9.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love this entry into the Chinese Zodiac challenge.  Very very well done.  You captured these guys (gals?) at the perfect moment and I love your choice to keep the photo in black and white.  I can''t give you a score, but if I could, it would surely be at least a 9.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-01-27 12:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(558968, 56727, 9295, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but with the bottom monkey being slightly off, it disrupts the symmetry. The lighting is also a little harsh for my taste. I wonder if it would have worked out a little better had you only used one monkey and utilized the rule of thirds in some way.  Anyway, I can''t give you a score so take the comments for what they''re worth. ;-)</td>', 'Cute idea but with the bottom monkey being slightly off, it disrupts the symmetry. The lighting is also a little harsh for my taste. I wonder if it would have worked out a little better had you only used one monkey and utilized the rule of thirds in some way.  Anyway, I can''t give you a score so take the comments for what they''re worth. ;-)', '2004-01-27 12:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
