(562396, 56737, 9906, '<td valign="top">First the title doesn''t seem to match the background of the shot.  The fire effect seems to surround the dragon not come out of it''s mouth.  The dragon itself is hard to see because of underexposure.  A touch of fill lighting (or side lighting to get depth) would be nice here!<br/>TC</td>', 'First the title doesn''t seem to match the background of the shot.  The fire effect seems to surround the dragon not come out of it''s mouth.  The dragon itself is hard to see because of underexposure.  A touch of fill lighting (or side lighting to get depth) would be nice here!TC', '2004-01-29 20:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(562397, 56545, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice fire effect, but the dragon itself seems disjointed and you can''t seem to tell which parts of the mythological creature you are looking at.  Some fill lighting would be beneficial.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice fire effect, but the dragon itself seems disjointed and you can''t seem to tell which parts of the mythological creature you are looking at.  Some fill lighting would be beneficial.TC', '2004-01-29 20:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
