(562620, 56704, 11078, '<td valign="top">Too close but good detail</td>', 'Too close but good detail', '2004-01-29 23:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(562622, 56666, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image very good detail but blue? its a really good effect though so I think you chose the right colour great work</td>', 'Nice sharp image very good detail but blue? its a really good effect though so I think you chose the right colour great work', '2004-01-29 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(562624, 56540, 11078, '<td valign="top">What a great effect and imagination well done 7</td>', 'What a great effect and imagination well done 7', '2004-01-29 23:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(562625, 56750, 11078, '<td valign="top">very nice I bet he is cold  I like the detail and the softness you have given the animal</td>', 'very nice I bet he is cold  I like the detail and the softness you have given the animal', '2004-01-29 23:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(562630, 56530, 6008, '<td valign="top">The horse is good, I like the coloring and texture, and it has a somewhat soft look too. Not fond of the desaturated backgroun, but I can see how it''s used to isolate the horse. I really dislike the white bar at the bottom, tho. It''s slanted and quite a distraction.</td>', 'The horse is good, I like the coloring and texture, and it has a somewhat soft look too. Not fond of the desaturated backgroun, but I can see how it''s used to isolate the horse. I really dislike the white bar at the bottom, tho. It''s slanted and quite a distraction.', '2004-01-29 23:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(562635, 56621, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very cute, has a wonderful soft look, the expression is cute, almost like he''s wondering what''s happening to him/her. I like the position of the crate too, gives the image a little more depth and interest.</td>', 'Very cute, has a wonderful soft look, the expression is cute, almost like he''s wondering what''s happening to him/her. I like the position of the crate too, gives the image a little more depth and interest.', '2004-01-29 23:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(562638, 56512, 6008, '<td valign="top">Without the background this would have probably been an ok cuddly toy shot, but I think with the background it actually works. It''s cute, composition is good, and it has more relevancy. Good use of dof, lighting/exposure is good, and the monkey is sharp. Fun shot!</td>', 'Without the background this would have probably been an ok cuddly toy shot, but I think with the background it actually works. It''s cute, composition is good, and it has more relevancy. Good use of dof, lighting/exposure is good, and the monkey is sharp. Fun shot!', '2004-01-29 23:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(562641, 56751, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s a clear shot, good details (which is hard in a darker dog), good lighting with no obvious shadows, and the background is non-distracting. I''m leaning towards disliking the collar. I think having it not there at all, or backing up a little and showing the entire collar may have been better.</td>', 'It''s a clear shot, good details (which is hard in a darker dog), good lighting with no obvious shadows, and the background is non-distracting. I''m leaning towards disliking the collar. I think having it not there at all, or backing up a little and showing the entire collar may have been better.', '2004-01-29 23:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(562644, 56638, 6008, '<td valign="top">This has great energy! The exposure on the snow is good, and you even captured those tiny sparkles of fresh snow. It''s a good motion capture with no blur, although the head could have been just a tad sharper. Compositionally he''s dead center, but I think having him bound toward the viewer gives it the dynamic of a dog rushing to meet his owner.</td>', 'This has great energy! The exposure on the snow is good, and you even captured those tiny sparkles of fresh snow. It''s a good motion capture with no blur, although the head could have been just a tad sharper. Compositionally he''s dead center, but I think having him bound toward the viewer gives it the dynamic of a dog rushing to meet his owner.', '2004-01-29 23:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(562646, 56532, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of the inverted or oversaturated, funky edited pop art look, sorry.</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of the inverted or oversaturated, funky edited pop art look, sorry.', '2004-01-29 23:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(562647, 56621, 8367, '<td valign="top">Such an adorable bunny. I love his markings. Great photo.</td>', 'Such an adorable bunny. I love his markings. Great photo.', '2004-01-29 23:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(562649, 56490, 6008, '<td valign="top">The quality isnt really the best and the background has a little noise in it. Composition is fine, but the subject is also slightly blurry. It could be your camera, else you should try and use a lot of light for the camera to focus better and also use a tripod or a sturdy surface to rest the camera on if you are not.</td>', 'The quality isnt really the best and the background has a little noise in it. Composition is fine, but the subject is also slightly blurry. It could be your camera, else you should try and use a lot of light for the camera to focus better and also use a tripod or a sturdy surface to rest the camera on if you are not.', '2004-01-29 23:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(562652, 56666, 6008, '<td valign="top">The duotone is interesting but you usually see these chinese dragons in a lot of very vibrant colors. It looks like it has either camera shake blur or motion blur, but that could work to denote motion of the dragon as it moves toward the viewer. It fills the frame, which is a good thing.</td>', 'The duotone is interesting but you usually see these chinese dragons in a lot of very vibrant colors. It looks like it has either camera shake blur or motion blur, but that could work to denote motion of the dragon as it moves toward the viewer. It fills the frame, which is a good thing.', '2004-01-29 23:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(562655, 56746, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good color, lighting, and good composition with the lizard/dragon coming diagonally from the corner. Not a real fan of the rocks, though, the dof looks kinda weird on them. The lizard/dragon has a great texture and is nicely sharp.</td>', 'Good color, lighting, and good composition with the lizard/dragon coming diagonally from the corner. Not a real fan of the rocks, though, the dof looks kinda weird on them. The lizard/dragon has a great texture and is nicely sharp.', '2004-01-29 23:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(562658, 56655, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the dragon, I looks wooden. The shadow is also interesting and adds an intimidation that normally are associated with dragons. The carving/figurine is nicely detailed and sharp. Only negative is the harsh/overexposed light coming from the lower right corner. I''m assuming you had to have the light that close to get the desired shadow, but the blown out area is very noticable and probably the best way to have avoided that would have been to move the light a little farther back and play with the EV levels.</td>', 'I like the texture of the dragon, I looks wooden. The shadow is also interesting and adds an intimidation that normally are associated with dragons. The carving/figurine is nicely detailed and sharp. Only negative is the harsh/overexposed light coming from the lower right corner. I''m assuming you had to have the light that close to get the desired shadow, but the blown out area is very noticable and probably the best way to have avoided that would have been to move the light a little farther back and play with the EV levels.', '2004-01-29 23:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(562666, 56608, 4493, '<td valign="top">Excellent work Ben! Very very good shot!</td>', 'Excellent work Ben! Very very good shot!', '2004-01-30 00:06:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(562668, 56608, 327, '<td valign="top">Awesome Ben. congrats!!!!</td>', 'Awesome Ben. congrats!!!!', '2004-01-30 00:08:47.000000', NULL, 0),
