(562704, 56532, 14499, '<td valign="top">You have done some good work in the past, it''s a pitty about this shot. I really thought it was done by a real ammature, but obviously not!</td>', 'You have done some good work in the past, it''s a pitty about this shot. I really thought it was done by a real ammature, but obviously not!', '2004-01-30 00:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
