(562907, 56608, 2780, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by °°gummi°°:</b></div><hr/><i> great photo, the title is extra funny for Icelanders because kind means sheep in Icelandic  :o) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wow, ya learn something new every day. That''s such a coincidence! <br/> <br/>On a similar note, I realised half way through voting that the number 4 is actually bad luck in China (hence why there is no Canon G4 camera) so I''m sorry if I accidently offended anyone, with it being in a Chinese-based challenge and all that.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-30 08:21:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by °°gummi°°: great photo, the title is extra funny for Icelanders because kind means sheep in Icelandic  :o)   Wow, ya learn something new every day. That''s such a coincidence!  On a similar note, I realised half way through voting that the number 4 is actually bad luck in China (hence why there is no Canon G4 camera) so I''m sorry if I accidently offended anyone, with it being in a Chinese-based challenge and all that.', '2004-01-30 08:21:21.000000', '2004-01-30 08:21:59.000000', 0),
