(563398, 56701, 3032, '<td valign="top">I liked the composition of this. Your shooting angle, frame filling, combination of still &amp; motion, wow colors (lanterns) and sharpness made in one of the most interesting photos in this challenge for me.<br/>It is a busy scene, but it manages to entertain the eye for quite a while. I gave it a 9.</td>', 'I liked the composition of this. Your shooting angle, frame filling, combination of still & motion, wow colors (lanterns) and sharpness made in one of the most interesting photos in this challenge for me.It is a busy scene, but it manages to entertain the eye for quite a while. I gave it a 9.', '2004-01-30 17:46:45.000000', NULL, 0),
