(564015, 56739, 10643, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. If I''d had any control over the snake''s position, my angle for the shot, or the lighting, I might have changed some or all of them. But the zoo frowns on people breaking the glass and climbing in to rearrange or re-light a snake big enough to eat a small gazelle. :)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. If I''d had any control over the snake''s position, my angle for the shot, or the lighting, I might have changed some or all of them. But the zoo frowns on people breaking the glass and climbing in to rearrange or re-light a snake big enough to eat a small gazelle. :)', '2004-01-31 16:55:13.000000', NULL, 0),
